        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Immerse yourself in the grim and tense atmosphere of an abandoned motel and its surroundings. Every dark corner could hide a clue or a threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Story:</strong> Unravel a web of mysteries. What happened on this road? Who is the enigmatic manager, and why does everything feel so surreal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Pressure:</strong> The game challenges your psyche not just with jumpscares, but with constant anxiety, visual distortions, and sounds that will make you look over your shoulder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong> To survive and progress, you'll need to find keys, decipher codes, and pay close attention to the smallest details in your environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you distinguish dream from reality and escape this place before it consumes you forever?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration:</strong> Immerse yourself in the grim and tense atmosphere of an abandoned motel and its surroundings. Every dark corner could hide a clue or a threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Story:</strong> Unravel a web of mysteries. What happened on this road? Who is the enigmatic manager, and why does everything feel so surreal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Pressure:</strong> The game challenges your psyche not just with jumpscares, but with constant anxiety, visual distortions, and sounds that will make you look over your shoulder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong> To survive and progress, you'll need to find keys, decipher codes, and pay close attention to the smallest details in your environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you distinguish dream from reality and escape this place before it consumes you forever?</p>",
